# Call the Mountain Chocobo (CR 701.23, 205.3i): it searches for a Mountain card - the Volcanic Island (a nonbasic Island Mountain) is
# the only one in the library, the Forest and Island in the hand do not matter - reveals it, and makes a 2/2 green Bird. "Whenever a
# land you control enters, this token gets +1/+0 until end of turn": Bot1's Volcanic Island makes it 3/2 that turn; the Island Bot2
# plays on turn 2 does not, and by then the pump has worn off anyway.

